328. The summary of the risk management plan must be consistent
with the information provided in Modules CVII, CVIII of Part II and
Parts III, IV, and V of the risk management plan and shall contain the
following information:
       a) the name of the medicinal product and the purposes for which its
use is approved;
       b) summary of safety concerns and missing information;
       c) routine and additional risk minimisation measures;
       d) additional pharmacovigilance activities;
